    <string name="onboarding_cloud_body">Optionally, TrustCheck can check links against threat-intelligence services and explain results with AI. Only the link (without personal parameters) is sent, and only if you turn this on.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_cloud_title">Cloud checks (optional)</string>
    <string name="onboarding_data_body">Your history stays on this device and contains only link addresses and results — never your messages. You can delete it at any time and set how long it is kept.</string>
